  m_text: In a fight, enemies will have a timer and an indicator beside their icon,
    telling you when they will act and what they will do. They can attack, defend,
    or rest. To attack, drag offensive cards from your hand onto the enemy's icon.
    To defend, drag defensive cards onto the icon beside your hand.
